msgstr "I saw the delivery notice on the board in the back alley. Did packages for Baek Doha ever get left here too?"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2976)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2976)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptQuestion"
msgid "그 마지막 택배요. 누가 언제 찾아갔는지 남아 있어요?"
msgstr "That last package. Is there a record of who picked it up, and when?"

#. Key:	NarinRoofQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2978)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2978)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRoofQuestion"
