msgstr "Is the roof door in my building usually kept locked? There was a padlock on it."

#. Key:	NarinRepeatQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2981)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2981)
