msgstr "Can you think of anything else?"

#. Key:	NarinFirstQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2982)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2982)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinFirstQuestion"
