msgstr "I just moved into Unit 403 at Moonlight Villa. Do you know someone named Baek Doha? He’s my brother."

#. Key:	NarinLaterQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2983)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2983)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLaterQuestion"
msgid "또 왔어요. 혹시 그 뒤로 들으신 거 없어요?"
msgstr "Me again. Have you heard anything since?"

#. Key:	YudamNarinMilkThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2998)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2998)
