msgstr "That one was for me. He brought it every time he came."

#. Key:	NarinReceiptAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3032)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3032)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptAnswer"
msgid "포스에 남아 있을 거예요. 잠깐만요, 찾아볼게요."
msgstr "It should still be in the register. Hang on, let me look."

#. Key:	ArrivalContractPrintedRead
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3092)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3092)
