msgstr "Someone must be sorting things in the storage room."

#. Key:	UsedListingMemoThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3379)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3379)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingMemoThought"
msgid "관리실 책상 메모에 있던 그 거래네. 8월 12일, 3만 원."
msgstr "That’s the sale from the note on the office desk. August 12, 30,000 won."

#. Key:	UsedListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3383)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3383)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingThought"
msgid "오빠 공구랑 똑같다. 판 사람이… ‘달빛’?"
msgstr "Same tools as my brother’s. The seller’s username is… “Moonlight”?"

#. Key:	RearDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3408)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3408)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,RearDoorCaption"
msgid "철문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "a steel door closing"

#. Key:	StoreReceiptThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3428)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3428)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreReceiptThought"
msgid "8월 2일이면 오빠가 없어진 뒤잖아."
msgstr "August 2nd? That’s after my brother disappeared."

#. Key:	StoreTerminalCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3488)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3488)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StoreTerminalCaption"
msgid "[계산대 단말기를 삑삑 누르는 소리]"
msgstr "[keys beeping on the counter terminal]"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptFound
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3522)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3522)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptFound"
msgid "작년 8월 2일이네요. 건물주 아저씨가 대신 받아 가셨어요. 한 장 뽑아 드릴게요."
msgstr "August 2nd last year. The landlord picked it up for him. I’ll print you a copy."

#. Key:	StorePrinterCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3590)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3590)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,StorePrinterCaption"
msgid "[영수증이 뽑혀 나오다 딸깍 잘리는 소리]"
msgstr "[a receipt printing, then the cutter clicking]"

#. Key:	NarinReceiptHere
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3607)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3607)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinReceiptHere"
msgid "여기 있어요."
msgstr "Here you go."

#. Key:	NarinDeliveryAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3639)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3639)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinDeliveryAnswer"
msgid "작년 여름에 몇 번 맡겼어요. 마지막 건 건물주 아저씨가 찾아가셨고요. 오빠분이 부탁했다고 하던데요."
msgstr "A few got left here last summer. The landlord came and picked up the last one. He said your brother asked him to."

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDayReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3655)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3655)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDayReceipt"
msgid "그 영수증 잘 챙겨 두세요. 필요하면 저도 본 대로 말할게요. 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "Keep that receipt safe. If it comes to it, I’ll say exactly what I saw. If anything happens, come straight over."

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3660)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3660)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDay"
msgid "아직은요. 저 오늘도 밤새 있으니까, 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "Not yet. I’m here all night again tonight, so if anything happens, come straight over."

#. Key:	NarinLineRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3669)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3669)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineRoof"
msgid "옥상요? 작년 여름에 건물주 아저씨가 자물쇠를 싹 바꿨대요. 열쇠는 관리실에나 있을걸요."
msgstr "The roof? I heard the landlord changed all the locks last summer. If anyone has a key, it’s the management office."

#. Key:	NarinLineMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3676)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3676)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMilk"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 아, 오빠분 오실 때마다 바나나우유를 두 개씩 사 가셨어요. 하나는 꼭 가방 앞주머니에 넣고요."
msgstr "Still no news? Oh, your brother used to buy two banana milks every time he came. He always put one in the front pocket of his bag."

#. Key:	NarinLineMidWeek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3683)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3683)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMidWeek"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 저도 단골들한테 물어봤는데, 최근에 봤다는 사람은 없더라고요."
msgstr "Still no news? I asked some of my regulars too, but nobody’s seen him lately."

#. Key:	NarinRepeatAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3690)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3690)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatAnswer"
msgid "지금은 그 정도예요. 다른 손님들한테도 한번 물어볼게요."
msgstr "That’s all I’ve got for now. I’ll ask my other customers too."

#. Key:	ArrivalNarinLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3695)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3695)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalNarinLine"
msgid "큰 가방 메고 다니시던 분이죠? 작년 여름부터 못 봤어요. 근데 403호에 오셨구나. 1년 새 세 번째예요, 그 집. 옆집은 봄부터 비어 있고요."
msgstr "He used to carry that big bag, right? I haven’t seen him since last summer. You said 403? You’re the third person in there in a year. Next door’s been empty since spring."

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveExplore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3733)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3733)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveExplore"
msgid "짐 풀고 빌라와 편의점 둘러보기"
msgstr "Unpack and explore the building and store"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveContract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3737)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3737)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveContract"
msgid "책상 위 임대차계약서 보기"
msgstr "Read the lease on the desk"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveBoxes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3741)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3741)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveBoxes"
msgid "오빠가 남긴 짐 살펴보기"
msgstr "Look through my brother’s things"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveStore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3745)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveStore"
msgid "편의점 직원에게 오빠 소식 묻기"
msgstr "Ask the shop clerk about my brother"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3750)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3750)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveNeighbors"
msgid "401호, 402호 앞 살펴보기"
msgstr "Look around outside 401 and 402"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3754)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3754)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveRoof"
msgid "계약서에 적힌 옥상 문 확인하기"
msgstr "Check the roof door the lease mentions"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveSleep
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3756)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3756)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveSleep"
msgid "403호로 돌아가서 자기"
msgstr "Go back to 403 and sleep"

#. Key:	BaselineStairsCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3963)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3963)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineStairsCaption"
msgid "계단을 내려가는 발소리"
msgstr "footsteps going downstairs"

#. Key:	BaselinePipeCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3991)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3991)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselinePipeCaption"
msgid "벽 속 배관으로 물 내려가는 소리"
msgstr "water running down a pipe in the wall"

#. Key:	BaselineDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4045)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4045)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BaselineDoorCaption"
msgid "현관문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "a front door closing"

#. Key:	NightOneSolvedThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4270)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4270)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneSolvedThought"
msgid "…위에 뭐가 있어."
msgstr "…Something’s up there."

#. Key:	NightOneAboveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4377)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4377)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveThought"
msgid "형광등 소리야. 이 위에 불 켜진 데가 있나 봐."
msgstr "That’s a fluorescent light. There must be a light on somewhere up there."

#. Key:	NightOneAboveKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4404)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4404)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneAboveKnockCaption"
msgid "천장에서 한 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "a single knock from the ceiling"

#. Key:	NightRestPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4423)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4423)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestPrompt"
msgid "아침까지 쉬기"
msgstr "Rest until morning"

#. Key:	NightRestBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4448)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4448)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightRestBlocked"
msgid "아직 밖에 뭐가 있어. 지금은 못 누워."
msgstr "Something’s still out there. I can’t lie down now."

#. Key:	ReportSentSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4732)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4732)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSentSpeaker"
msgid "보낸 문자"
msgstr "Sent message"

#. Key:	EvictionPhotoSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4733)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4733)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionPhotoSent"
msgid "[사진] 관리인이 4층 엘리베이터 옆에 붙인 종이입니다. 내일 오전 7시에 옥상 누수 공사를 한답니다. 그 전에 5층 벽을 꼭 확인해 주세요."
msgstr "[Photo] The building manager put this up by the fourth-floor elevator. He says they’re fixing a roof leak at 7 a.m. tomorrow. Please check the fifth-floor wall before then."

#. Key:	EvictionDeadlineThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4747)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4747)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionDeadlineThought"
msgid "일곱 시에 벽을 덮으면… 그 전에 와 줄 수 있을까."
msgstr "He’s covering the wall at seven… Will they get here in time?"

#. Key:	FirstReportSignalThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4770)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4770)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSignalThought"
msgid "신호 잡힌다. 112에 문자부터 보내자."
msgstr "I’ve got a signal. I’ll text 112 first."

#. Key:	FirstReportSentCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4782)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4782)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSentCover"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 벽 옆 구석에 덧판이 박혀 있는데, 제가 가진 덮개가 그 자리에 딱 맞아요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "I’m at Moonlight Villa, 27-3 Muyeong-ro. There’s a room on the roof where my brother Baek Doha lived before he went missing last July. I can hear knocking inside the wall. Someone might be in there. There’s a board nailed over the corner next to the wall, and the cover I have fits that spot exactly. Please come."

#. Key:	FirstReportSentAssembled
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4787)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4787)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSentAssembled"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 건물에서 나온 덮개 조각을 맞춰 보니 통기 구멍을 막아 놓은 덮개였어요. 그 덮개는 제가 갖고 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "I’m at Moonlight Villa, 27-3 Muyeong-ro. There’s a room on the roof where my brother Baek Doha lived before he went missing last July. I can hear knocking inside the wall. Someone might be in there. I put together pieces of a cover I found in the building, and it’s a cover that was used to block off a vent. I have that cover. Please come."

#. Key:	FirstReportSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4791)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4791)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSent"
msgid "무영로 27-3 달빛빌라입니다. 옥상에 방이 하나 있어요. 작년 7월에 실종된 오빠 백도하가 살던 곳인데, 벽 안에서 두드리는 소리가 나요. 사람일 수도 있어요. 와 주세요."
msgstr "I’m at Moonlight Villa, 27-3 Muyeong-ro. There’s a room on the roof where my brother Baek Doha lived before he went missing last July. I can hear knocking inside the wall. Someone might be in there. Please come."

#. Key:	ReportSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4810)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4810)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ReportSpeaker"
msgid "112"
msgstr "112"

#. Key:	FirstReportReceipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4811)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4811)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportReceipt"
msgid "[112 문자신고] 신고가 접수됐습니다. 담당 경찰관이 확인 후 연락드리겠습니다."
msgstr "[112 Text Report] Your report has been received. An officer will review it and contact you."

#. Key:	SiteCheckSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4833)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4833)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckSpeaker"
msgid "무영경찰서 실종수사팀"
msgstr "Muyeong Police Station, Missing Persons"

#. Key:	FirstReportSiteCheck
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4834)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4834)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSiteCheck"
msgid "옥탑은 확인했습니다. 지금은 안에서 소리나 움직임이 없어요. 보내 주신 자료로 추가 확인 중입니다. 다시 소리가 나면 바로 연락 주시고, 벽에는 손대지 마세요."
msgstr "We’ve checked the rooftop room. There’s no sound or movement from inside at the moment. We’re following up on the documents you sent. If you hear it again, let us know right away, and please leave the wall alone."

#. Key:	FirstReportDispatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4903)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4903)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportDispatch"
msgid "순찰 경찰관이 지금 그쪽으로 가고 있습니다. 옥상은 관리인분이 열어 주기로 했어요."
msgstr "A patrol officer is on the way to you now. The building manager has agreed to open the roof."

#. Key:	SiteCheckGoUpThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4912)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4912)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckGoUpThought"
msgid "옥상에 먼저 올라가 있자."
msgstr "I’ll head up to the roof and wait for them."

#. Key:	ArrivalSleepBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5174)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5174)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalSleepBlocked"
msgid "아직 볼 게 남았어."
msgstr "I’m not done looking around."

#. Key:	SiteCheckSleepBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5202)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5202)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,SiteCheckSleepBlocked"
msgid "경찰이 온다고 했잖아. 옥상에 가 봐야지."
msgstr "The police are coming. I should go up to the roof."

#. Key:	EvictionNoticeSleepBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5209)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5209)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticeSleepBlocked"
msgid "엘리베이터 옆에 붙은 종이부터 보자."
msgstr "I should check that paper by the elevator first."

#. Key:	NightAlarmCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5350)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5350)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightAlarmCaption"
msgid "[04:30 알람]"
msgstr "[04:30 alarm]"

#. Key:	NightFourHammerThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5376)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5376)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourHammerThought"
msgid "낮에 사 온 망치로 해 보자."
msgstr "I’ll try the hammer I bought earlier."

#. Key:	NightOneCeilingKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5547)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5547)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneCeilingKnockCaption"
msgid "천장에서 세 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "three knocks from the ceiling"

#. Key:	NightTorchThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5581)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5581)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightTorchThought"
msgid "손전등… 머리맡에 뒀지."
msgstr "The flashlight… I left it by the bed."

#. Key:	NightOneOpeningDragCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5648)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5648)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneOpeningDragCaption"
msgid "천장에서 뭔가 끄는 소리"
msgstr "something dragged across the ceiling"

#. Key:	NightOneTopFloorThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5679)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5679)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightOneTopFloorThought"
msgid "…4층이 꼭대기인데."
msgstr "…But the fourth floor is the top floor."

#. Key:	RoofDriverCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5708)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5708)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,RoofDriverCaption"
