msgstr "No signal, either."

#. Key:	Hwang401PeekCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6091)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6091)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401PeekCaption"
msgid "401호 문 살짝 열리는 소리"
msgstr "401’s door opening a crack"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6127)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6127)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,HwangSpeaker"
msgid "황순금"
msgstr "Hwang Sun-geum"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6128)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6128)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "You were out before dawn, weren’t you? Go in and get some sleep."

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6174)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6174)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "You’re new in 403? Close your door gently at night, would you? Sound carries in this building."

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6190)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6190)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "물탱크 청소할 때는 배관이 꽤 시끄러워요. 그거라도 틀어 놔 봐요. 누가 뭐라 하면 내가 얘기할게요."
msgstr "Those pipes make a racket when the tank’s being cleaned. Try running the water. I’ll deal with any complaints."

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6198)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6198)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "The wall kept banging, so I knocked back the same way. And that night, it went quiet."

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6206)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6206)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "옥상 열쇠는 관리인이 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "The manager always leaves the roof keys on his desk. If he won’t let you in, come and tell me."

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6214)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6214)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "I heard it that day too. They say nobody was there, but I know what I heard."

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6225)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "I’ve called so many times. He always says it’s the pipes. Could you check whether he even wrote it in the complaint ledger?"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6233)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6233)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "If the power’s out, look in the lobby meter box. The meter reading log’s there too."

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6286)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6286)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "the chanting inside stops"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6372)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6372)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "Read what I hung on the door. They say nobody was there, but I know what I heard."

#. Key:	Hwang401SonDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6388)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6388)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401SonDay"
msgid "이삿짐 들어오던 날, 그날이 손 있는 날이었어요."
msgstr "The day you moved in… They say spirits wander on days like that. A bad day to move."

#. Key:	Hwang401DontOpen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6395)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6395)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DontOpen"
msgid "문 두드린다고 다 열어 주는 거 아니에요."
msgstr "Just because someone knocks doesn’t mean you open the door."

#. Key:	Hwang401Drill
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6416)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6416)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Drill"
msgid "새벽에 옥상에서 드릴 소리 났죠? 403호에 새 사람 들 때마다 그 양반이 그래요. 첫날 새벽엔 꼭 올라가요."
msgstr "You heard a drill on the roof before dawn, didn’t you? That man does it every time someone new moves into 403. He always goes up that first morning."

#. Key:	YudamHwangDrillThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6436)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6436)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamHwangDrillThought"
msgid "새 사람이 들 때마다? 뭘 막으러 올라가나?"
msgstr "Whenever someone new moves in? What’s he covering up there?"

#. Key:	Hwang401DarkWarning
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6449)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DarkWarning"
msgid "새벽에 깜깜한 데서 뭐가 보이거든 쳐다보지 말아요."
msgstr "If you see something in the dark before dawn, don’t look at it."

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6493)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6493)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamToHwangAnswer"
msgid "벽 안에서 대답이 왔어요. 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 오빠가 문 두드리던 박자예요."
msgstr "An answer came back from inside the wall. Two, pause, one. That’s how my brother used to knock."

#. Key:	Hwang401IsItYourBrother
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6503)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6503)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401IsItYourBrother"
msgid "아이고… 그 사람이 오빠였어요?"
msgstr "Oh, dear. That was your brother?"

#. Key:	Hwang401Permission
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6510)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6510)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Permission"
msgid "꺼내 줘요. 거기 혼자 두지 말고."
msgstr "Get him out of there. Don’t leave him alone in there."

#. Key:	NightFourWallNeedsCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6567)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(6567)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourWallNeedsCover"
msgid "지금 치면 금방 들키겠어."
msgstr "They’ll hear me as soon as I hit it."

#. Key:	DayObjectiveNotice
