msgstr "He took the key ring."

#. Key:	YudamMokBroughtHome
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1177)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1177)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokBroughtHome"
msgid "집까지 데려다 놓고 갔네."
msgstr "He walked me all the way home and just left."

#. Key:	CaptionMokHurries
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1224)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1224)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokHurries"
msgid "[슬리퍼 소리가 급히 멀어진다]"
msgstr "[slippers hurrying away]"

#. Key:	YudamMokAvoidsFourth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1511)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(1511)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokAvoidsFourth"
msgid "4층 복도로는 안 들어와."
msgstr "He won’t set foot in the fourth-floor hallway."

#. Key:	CaptionMokChainDrop
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2023)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2023)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokChainDrop"
msgid "[사슬이 바닥에 떨어지는 소리]"
msgstr "[a chain dropping to the floor]"

#. Key:	CaptionMokChain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2080)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2080)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokChain"
msgid "[쇠사슬이 철컥거리는 소리]"
msgstr "[a chain clanking]"

#. Key:	CaptionMokCartSqueak
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2094)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2094)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokCartSqueak"
msgid "[손수레 바퀴가 끽끽거리는 소리]"
msgstr "[hand cart wheels squeaking]"

#. Key:	YudamMokKeyHunt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2181)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2181)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokKeyHunt"
msgid "4층까지 올라오네. 열쇠 찾으러 온 거야."
msgstr "He came all the way up to the fourth floor. He’s looking for the keys."

#. Key:	CaptionGuestKeypad
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2259)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2259)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionGuestKeypad"
msgid "[밖에서 도어락 번호를 누른다]"
msgstr "[someone outside punching in the door lock code]"

#. Key:	CaptionGuestLatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2273)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2273)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionGuestLatch"
msgid "[걸쇠에 문이 걸려 덜컥거린다]"
msgstr "[the door catches on the latch and rattles]"

#. Key:	CaptionGuestBolt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2391)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2391)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionGuestBolt"
msgid "[빗장에 걸려 문이 덜컹거린다]"
msgstr "[the door catches on the bolt and rattles]"

#. Key:	YudamMokBoltHeld
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2425)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2425)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokBoltHeld"
msgid "빗장 걸어 두길 잘했다."
msgstr "Good thing I bolted the door."

#. Key:	CaptionMokSlamsAnnex
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2474)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2474)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokSlamsAnnex"
msgid "[철문이 쾅 닫히는 소리]"
msgstr "[a steel door slamming shut]"

#. Key:	YudamMokAvoidsAnnex
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2478)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2478)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokAvoidsAnnex"
msgid "5층에는 안 들어와."
msgstr "He won’t set foot on the fifth floor."

#. Key:	YudamMokFirstHeard
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2516)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2516)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokFirstHeard"
msgid "관리인 아저씨네. 어제 관리실 들어간 걸 알아챘나?"
msgstr "It’s the building manager. Did he notice I was in the office yesterday?"

#. Key:	YudamMokTorchWarning
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2565)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2565)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokTorchWarning"
msgid "저 불빛에 오래 있으면 들켜."
msgstr "If I stay in that light too long, he’ll see me."

#. Key:	YudamMokHeardKnock
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2794)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(2794)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamMokHeardKnock"
msgid "저 사람도 들은 거야. 지금 그 소리."
msgstr "He heard it too. That sound just now."

#. Key:	CaptionMokDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(821)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(821)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokDoor"
msgid "[관리실 문이 열리는 소리]"
msgstr "[the management office door opens]"

#. Key:	CaptionMokStopped
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(886)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(886)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokStopped"
msgid "[열쇠 소리가 뚝 멎는다]"
msgstr "[the keys suddenly stop jingling]"

#. Key:	CaptionMokQuicken
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(920)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGManagerPatrol.cpp(920)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CaptionMokQuicken"
msgid "[발소리가 빨라진다]"
msgstr "[the footsteps speed up]"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooDoor
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1002)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1002)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayJeongwooDoor"
msgid "“먼저 나가세요. 문은 제가 닫을게요.”"
msgstr "“You go on ahead. I’ll close the door.”"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1008)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1008)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "403호 열쇠는 반납함에 넣었다."
msgstr "I dropped the key to 403 in the return box."

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1015)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1015)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayMilk"
msgid "나오는 길에 바나나우유를 두 개 샀다. 하나는 가방 앞주머니에 넣었다."
msgstr "On the way out, I bought two banana milks and put one in the front pocket of my bag."

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1027)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1027)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote1"
msgid "붙어 있던 쪽지는 다 떼어지고, 하늘색 쪽지 한 장이 새로 붙어 있다."
msgstr "The old notes have all been taken down. One new pale blue note is taped in their place."

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1031)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1031)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNote2"
msgid "그동안 시끄럽다고만 해서 죄송합니다. 303호"
msgstr "I’m sorry I only ever complained about the noise. Unit 303"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1045)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1045)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews1"
msgid "무영로 다세대주택 벽 속에서 남성 유해 발견… 실종 1년 만"
msgstr "Man’s remains found in wall of Muyeong-ro building, a year after he went missing"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1054)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1054)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
msgstr "Police tracing landlord Mok, who left his office and cut off contact"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1058)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1058)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokA"
msgid "경찰, 관리실에 있던 건물주 목씨 상대로 사건 경위 조사"
msgstr "Police question landlord Mok, found in the management office"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1067)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1067)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방은 방음 시공돼 있었다"
msgstr "The back room of the office had been soundproofed"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1074)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1074)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3"
msgid "민원 대장 두 벌과 실종 당일·이튿날 자재 영수증이 확보됐다"
msgstr "Police recovered two versions of the complaint ledger and materials receipts from the day he vanished and the day after"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1085)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1085)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Recorder"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 유족이 제출한 녹음기가 자신의 것이라고 인정했다"
msgstr "Former tenant Seo admitted that a recorder handed in by the family was his"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1095)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1095)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Seen"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 “그 뒤로 새벽마다 깼다”며 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "Former tenant Seo says he “woke up at dawn every day after that” and will appear for questioning"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1102)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1102)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 변호인을 통해 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "Former tenant Seo says through his lawyer he will appear for questioning"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1113)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1113)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
msgid "건물 녹화 장치는 저장 디스크가 빠진 채로 발견됐다"
msgstr "The building’s CCTV recorder was found with its hard drive removed"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1122)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1122)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
msgid "관리실에 남은 지난해 7월 달력에는 26일에 표시가 돼 있었다"
msgstr "Last July’s calendar, left in the management office, had the 26th marked"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Receipt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1135)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1135)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Receipt"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 실종 일주일 뒤 건물주가 택배를 대신 받아 간 기록을 제출했다"
msgstr "A nearby store clerk handed over a record of the landlord picking up the package a week after the disappearance"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1143)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1143)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 사건 당일 야간 근무 중 들은 소리를 진술했다"
msgstr "A nearby store clerk described sounds she heard on her night shift that day"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Parcel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1151)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Parcel"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 실종자의 택배를 건물주가 찾아갔다고 진술했다"
msgstr "A nearby store clerk said the landlord had picked up the missing man’s packages"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1158)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(1158)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5"
msgid "경찰은 인근 편의점 직원의 목격 진술을 토대로 실종 당시 행적을 확인하고 있다"
msgstr "Police are retracing the man’s movements at the time from a nearby store clerk’s eyewitness account"

#. Key:	EpilogueMontageTape
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(469)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(469)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueMontageTape"
msgid "[테이프 뜯는 소리]"
msgstr "[tape tearing]"

#. Key:	EpilogueMontageGurney
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(477)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(477)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueMontageGurney"
msgid "[바퀴 소리가 복도를 지나 멀어진다]"
msgstr "[wheels rolling down the hall, fading]"

#. Key:	EpilogueMontageShutter
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(485)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(485)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueMontageShutter"
msgid "[카메라 셔터 소리, 세 번]"
msgstr "[a camera shutter, three times]"

#. Key:	EpilogueMontageSweep
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(493)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(493)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueMontageSweep"
msgid "[석고 조각 쓸어 담는 소리]"
msgstr "[plaster being swept up]"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshopHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(594)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(594)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshopHeading"
msgid "장례를 마친 뒤, 공방"
msgstr "Back at the workshop, after the funeral"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshopFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(599)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(599)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshopFootnote"
msgid "공방 벽에 업라이트 피아노 한 대가 그대로 서 있다"
msgstr "An upright piano still stands against the workshop wall"

#. Key:	EpilogueTuningCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(631)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(631)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueTuningCaption"
msgid "[같은 건반을 다시 누른다. 이번엔 음이 맞는다]"
msgstr "[the same key pressed again, in tune this time]"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(661)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(661)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnHeading"
msgid "가을, 무영로"
msgstr "Autumn, Muyeong-ro"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(666)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(666)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnFootnote"
msgid "네 시 반 알람은 지웠다"
msgstr "I deleted the 4:30 alarm"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(675)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(675)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsHeading"
msgid "뉴스"
msgstr "News"

#. Key:	EpilogueCardA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(693)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(693)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueCardA"
msgid "조율이 끝난 방"
msgstr "A Room in Tune"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorCloseCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(734)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(734)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorCloseCaption"
msgid "[403호 문이 조용히 닫히는 소리]"
msgstr "[the door to 403 closing quietly]"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(740)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(740)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayHeading"
msgid "방을 빼던 날, 5층"
msgstr "Fifth floor, the day I moved out"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(745)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayFootnote"
msgid "소리 일지는 401호 할머니께 돌려드렸다"
msgstr "I gave the sound log back to Mrs. Hwang in 401"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNoteHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(75)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(75)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNoteHeading"
msgid "403호 문"
msgstr "The door to 403"

#. Key:	EpilogueKeyDropCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(763)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(763)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueKeyDropCaption"
msgid "[열쇠가 반납함 바닥에 떨어지는 소리]"
msgstr "[a key hitting the bottom of the drop box]"

#. Key:	EpilogueFinalKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(786)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(786)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueFinalKnockCaption"
msgid "[위] 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "[above] two, pause, one"

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNoteFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(80)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(80)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueDoorNoteFootnote"
msgid "그날 새벽 망치 소리를 들은 303호는 위층에 올라가지 않고 119에 신고했다"
msgstr "That morning, the neighbor in 303 heard the hammering and called 119 instead of coming upstairs"

#. Key:	EpilogueRailingCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(806)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(806)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueRailingCaption"
msgid "[난간을 두 번 두드리는 소리]"
msgstr "[two knocks on the railing]"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsHeadingB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(816)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(816)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsHeadingB"
msgid "뉴스"
msgstr "News"

#. Key:	EpilogueCardB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(834)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(834)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueCardB"
msgid "같이 있던 밤"
msgstr "The Night I Stayed"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshopPouch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(858)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(858)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshopPouch"
msgid "챙겨 온 오빠 공구 주머니부터 입구 보관함에 넣는다."
msgstr "First, I put my brother’s tool pouch in the storage bin by the entrance."

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(863)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(863)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop1"
msgid "오빠가 쓰던 작업표가 아직 여기 있네."
msgstr "My brother’s job sheet is still here."

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(867)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(867)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop2"
msgid "업라이트 1대  ·  받는 분 백유담  ·  집들이 전에 전달"
msgstr "1 upright piano  ·  For Baek Yudam  ·  Deliver before the housewarming party"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop3"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 쥐어 본다. 손잡이 한쪽이 닳아 있다."
msgstr "I pick up the tuning hammer. One side of the grip is worn down."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(883)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(883)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1"
msgid "5층을 뜯어내고 있다. 크레인이 하루 종일 골목을 막고 서 있다."
msgstr "They’re tearing down the fifth floor. A crane’s been blocking the alley all day."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(892)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(892)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy"
msgid "402호에 불이 켜져 있다. 냉장고 소리가 복도까지 들린다."
msgstr "The lights are on in 402. I can hear the fridge from the hallway."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(901)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(901)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2Seen"
msgid "물그릇이 있던 401호 앞을 지난다. 창턱에 작은 라디오가 놓여 있다."
msgstr "I pass 401, where the water bowl used to be. There’s a small radio on the windowsill."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(908)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(908)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2"
msgid "401호 창턱에 작은 라디오가 놓여 있다."
msgstr "A small radio sits on 401’s windowsill."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Radio
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(918)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(918)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Radio"
msgid "문 너머로 듣던 그 불경 소리다. 창밖으로 들리게 틀어 놓으셨네."
msgstr "It’s the chanting I used to hear through her door. She’s playing it out the window."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(925)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(925)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Seen"
msgid "창밖 쪽으로 놓아두셨네. 골목까지 들리겠다."
msgstr "She’s set it facing outside. You’d hear it down in the alley."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnMilk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(933)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(933)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnMilk"
msgid "바나나우유를 두 개 사서 하나는 가방 앞주머니에 넣는다."
msgstr "I buy two banana milks and put one in the front pocket of my bag."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnJeongwooGuest
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(943)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(943)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnJeongwooGuest"
msgid "정우 씨가 헬멧을 벗고 인사한다. 요즘은 새벽에 문 두드리는 사람이 없대."
msgstr "Jeongwoo takes off his helmet to say hello. He says nobody knocks on doors before dawn anymore."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumnJeongwoo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(947)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(947)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumnJeongwoo"
msgid "공동현관 앞에서 정우 씨가 헬멧을 벗고 꾸벅 인사한다."
msgstr "Outside the front entrance, Jeongwoo takes off his helmet and gives a quick bow."

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(959)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(959)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1"
msgid "방수포도 카트도 치워졌다. 콘크리트에 자국만 남았다."
msgstr "The tarp and the cart are gone. Only marks left on the concrete."

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(964)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(964)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1b"
msgid "그날 밤 이후로 관리실에는 한 번도 불이 켜지지 않았다."
msgstr "The lights in the management office haven’t come on once since that night."

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay2"
