msgid "관리실 안쪽 방에 있었잖아요. 두드리는 소리 못 들었어요?"
msgstr "You were in the back room of the office. Didn’t you hear the knocking?"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyWind
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3293)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3293)
