msgid "바람 소리 아니었잖아요. 사람이 두드리고 있었어요."
msgstr "It wasn’t the wind. Someone was knocking."

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplySeoRecorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3306)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3306)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplySeoRecorder"
msgid "403호 그 사람 내려가고 나서 아저씨는 뭐 했어요?"
msgstr "After the man from 403 went back down, what did you do?"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3313)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3313)
