msgstr "My brother lived here. You knew that."

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyBowl
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3320)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3320)
