msgstr "Mrs. Hwang says she heard him. Why didn’t anyone go in and check?"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPills
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3327)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3327)
