#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(112)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall1Named"
msgid "정우 씨가 302호에서 판에 끼었다고 했어."
msgstr "Jeongwoo said he’s stuck behind a board in 302."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(113)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(113)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall1"
msgid "302호 안에서 누가 판에 끼었다고 했어."
msgstr "Someone in 302 said they’re stuck behind a board."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(114)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(114)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall2"
msgid "302호에 들어가서 판이 어떻게 걸렸는지 보자."
msgstr "I should go into 302 and see how the board’s caught."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageCall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(115)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(115)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageCall3"
msgid "3층 302호 문으로 들어가서 판 너머를 살펴보자."
msgstr "Go in through the door of 302 on the third floor and look behind the board."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace3Wedge
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(120)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(120)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace3Wedge"
msgid "쐐기는 장판 말고, 판 밑동이 철골 토막에 걸린 자리에 끼우자."
msgstr "Not on the vinyl floor — wedge it where the foot of the board catches on the steel stud."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace3Find
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(121)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(121)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace3Find"
msgid "문 옆 공사 찌꺼기에서 받칠 걸 찾아, 판 밑동이 철골 토막에 걸린 자리에 끼우자."
msgstr "Find something to brace it with in the construction scraps by the door, and wedge it where the foot of the board catches on the steel stud."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(125)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(125)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen1"
msgid "판이 더 내려앉았어. 밑동이 밀렸어."
msgstr "The board sank further. Its foot slid out."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(126)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(126)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen2"
msgid "밑동을 받쳐 두면 판을 다시 세울 수 있을 거야."
msgstr "If I brace the foot, I should be able to stand the board back up."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageFallen3Lift
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(128)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(128)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageFallen3Lift"
msgid "쐐기가 받치고 있으니 판을 다시 세우자."
msgstr "The wedge is holding it. Let’s stand the board back up."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace1"
msgid "판 밑동부터 보자."
msgstr "Check the foot of the board first."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageBrace2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageBrace2"
msgid "밑동이 밀리면 판이 더 누울 거야. 먼저 받쳐 두자."
msgstr "If the foot slips, the board will lie down further. I should brace it first."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(143)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(143)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap2Seen"
msgid "관리실에선 큰 점검구를 여니까 그리로 옮겨 갔지."
msgstr "In the management office, it moved over when the big hatch was opened."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(144)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(144)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap2"
msgid "더 넓은 틈이 생기면 그리로 옮겨 갈지도 몰라."
msgstr "If a wider gap opens up, it might move over there."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(147)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(147)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap1"
msgid "벽에 붙은 게 판을 누르고 있어."
msgstr "The thing stuck to the wall is pressing on the board."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap3Wardrobe
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(149)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(149)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap3Wardrobe"
msgid "장롱을 밀어서 뒤쪽 벽을 살펴보자."
msgstr "Push the wardrobe and check the wall behind it."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageHatch1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageHatch1"
msgid "장롱 뒤에 점검구가 있었어."
msgstr "There was an access hatch behind the wardrobe."

#. Key:	NightThreeStorageGap3Hatch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(153)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(153)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeStorageGap3Hatch"
msgid "장롱 뒤 점검구를 열자. 판을 누르던 게 그리로 옮겨 가면 판이 풀릴 거야."
msgstr "Open the hatch behind the wardrobe. If the thing pressing on the board moves in there, the board should come free."

#. Key:	ArrivalContract1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(162)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(162)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract1"
msgid "책상 위에 계약서를 뒀지. 한번 읽어 보자."
msgstr "I left the lease on the desk. I should give it a read."

#. Key:	ArrivalContract2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(163)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(163)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract2"
msgid "403호 책상 위 임대차계약서. 그것부터 보자."
msgstr "The lease on the desk in 403. I’ll start with that."

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes1"
msgid "짐을 아직 다 안 풀었네."
msgstr "I still haven’t finished unpacking."

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(171)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(171)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes2"
msgid "반송된 택배 상자, 조율 공구 상자, 예전 휴대폰 상자. 안 연 걸 열어 보자."
msgstr "The returned box, the box of tuning tools, the box with my old phone. I’ll open the ones I haven’t yet."

#. Key:	ArrivalStore1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(176)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(176)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore1"
msgid "편의점 사람이면 오빠를 봤을지도 몰라."
msgstr "Someone at the convenience store might have seen him."

#. Key:	ArrivalStore2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore2"
msgid "편의점에 가서 물어보자. 1층에서 골목으로 나가면 돼."
msgstr "I should ask at the store. Down to the first floor, then out into the alley."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(184)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(184)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors1"
msgid "같은 층 다른 집도 한번 둘러보자."
msgstr "I should check the other units on this floor too."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighborsBoth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighborsBoth"
msgid "401호는 문을 두드려 보고, 402호는 문에 붙은 메모를 읽어 보자."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door and read the note on 402’s."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors401
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(188)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(188)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors401"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자. 누가 사는지는 알아야지."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door. I should at least know who lives there."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors402
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(189)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(189)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors402"
msgid "402호 문에 붙은 메모를 아직 안 읽었네."
msgstr "I still haven’t read the note on 402’s door."

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(194)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(194)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof1"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 얘기가 있었는데."
msgstr "The lease said something about the roof."

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(195)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(195)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof2"
msgid "계단 끝까지 올라가서 옥상 문을 확인해 보자."
msgstr "I’ll go all the way up the stairs and check the roof door."

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep1"
msgid "오늘은 이만 자자."
msgstr "Time to call it a night."

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep2"
msgid "403호 침대에 눕자. 알람은 네 시 반에 맞춰 뒀어."
msgstr "I’ll get into bed in 403. The alarm’s set for 4:30 a.m."

#. Key:	NightOne3Dial
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(208)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(208)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Dial"
msgid "복도등을 끄고, 이름표 없는 차단기를 내렸다 올리면서 다섯 번째 원판을 보자."
msgstr "I’ll turn off the hallway lights, then flip the unlabeled breaker down and up and watch the fifth meter disc."

#. Key:	NightOne3Sheet
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Sheet"
msgid "검침 기록지에 계량기 다섯 개가 다 적혀 있는지 보자."
msgstr "I’ll check whether all five meters are listed in the meter reading log."

#. Key:	NightOne3Breaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(211)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(211)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Breaker"
msgid "이름표 없는 차단기를 올려 둔 채로 원판을 한 번 더 보자."
msgstr "I’ll leave the unlabeled breaker up and look at the meter disc again."

#. Key:	NightOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(213)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne1"
msgid "위에 누가 있으면 전기를 쓰겠지. 1층 계량기함을 봐야겠다."
msgstr "If someone’s up there, they’d be using power. I should check the lobby meter box."

#. Key:	NightOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(214)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(214)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne2"
msgid "계량기가 집마다 하나씩인지 세어 보자. 복도등을 꺼도 도는 게 있으면 다른 데로 전기가 가는 거야."
msgstr "I should count whether there’s one meter per unit. If one keeps turning with the hallway lights off, the power’s going somewhere else."

#. Key:	NightTwo3Carbon
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Carbon"
msgid "연필로 접수철 밑장을 끝까지 문질러 보자."
msgstr "I’ll rub a pencil over the whole sheet underneath in the intake pad."

#. Key:	NightTwo3Agent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Agent"
msgid "관리실 책상 위 부동산 문자 출력본도 읽어 보자."
msgstr "I should read the printout of the realtor’s texts on the office desk too."

#. Key:	NightTwo3Desk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(228)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Desk"
msgid "관리실 책상을 한 번 더 둘러보자."
msgstr "I’ll check the management office desk again."

#. Key:	NightTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(230)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(230)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo1"
msgid "소음 민원이 들어갔다면 관리실에 기록이 남았겠지."
msgstr "Any noise complaints would be on record at the management office."

#. Key:	NightTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(231)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(231)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo2"
msgid "민원 대장이랑 접수철을 같이 보자. 접수철 밑장에 눌린 자국이 남았을지도."
msgstr "I should look at the complaint ledger and the intake pad together. There might be indentations on the sheet underneath."

#. Key:	NightTwoInner1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(240)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner1"
msgid "아저씨가 자리를 비우면 안쪽 방을 봐야 해."
msgstr "When he steps out, I need to check the back room."

#. Key:	NightTwoInner2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(241)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(241)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner2"
msgid "안쪽 방에 뭐가 있는지 하나씩 살펴보자."
msgstr "I’ll go through what’s in the back room, one thing at a time."

#. Key:	NightTwoInner3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(242)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoInner3"
msgid "아저씨가 돌아오기 전에 관리실을 나가자."
msgstr "I’ll get out of the management office before he comes back."

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(250)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(250)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit1"
msgid "관리실에서 403호까지 돌아오는 길이 남았어."
msgstr "I still have to get back from the management office to 403."

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(251)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(251)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit2"
msgid "1층 관리실에 다시 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "I’ll stop by the first-floor office again, then come back to 403."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(255)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(255)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가야 해."
msgstr "I need to get back to 403 now."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(256)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(256)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn2"
msgid "계단으로 올라가서 403호 안까지. 발소리를 줄이자."
msgstr "Up the stairs and all the way inside 403. I’ll keep my footsteps quiet."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn3"
msgid "쫓아오면 뛰어서라도 403호 안으로 들어가자."
msgstr "If he comes after me, I’ll run for it. Just get inside 403."

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(270)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가자."
msgstr "Time to go back to 403."

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(271)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(271)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn2"
msgid "아까 벽에 그 박자로 두드리니까 다 조용해졌어. 복도에서도 통할까."
msgstr "When I knocked that rhythm on the wall earlier, everything went quiet. Would it work in the hallway too?"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(272)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(272)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn3"
msgid "복도에서 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 두드리고, 멈춘 사이에 403호로 들어가자."
msgstr "I’ll knock two, pause, one in the hallway and get into 403 while he’s stopped."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(283)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(283)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm1"
msgid "오빠가 문 두드리던 박자가 있었는데."
msgstr "My brother used to knock in a certain rhythm."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(284)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(284)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm2"
msgid "음성 메시지에서 그랬잖아. “문 두드리면 알지? 둘, 하나.”"
msgstr "He said it in the voicemail. “You know my knock, right? Two, then one.”"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(286)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(286)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에서 그 박자를 찾아보자."
msgstr "I’ll look for that rhythm in the tuning notebook."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(287)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(287)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그 박자로 비어 있는 벽을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "Two, pause, one. I’ll knock that rhythm on the hollow wall."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(295)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(295)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey1"
msgid "옥상 문을 열 열쇠가 있어야 해."
msgstr "I need a key to open the roof door."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(296)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(296)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey2"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었지."
msgstr "There was a key ring on the management office desk."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(297)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(297)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey3"
msgid "1층 관리실에서 열쇠 꾸러미를 챙겨서 옥상으로 올라가자."
msgstr "I’ll grab the key ring from the first-floor office and head up to the roof."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(305)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(305)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor1"
msgid "옥상부터 둘러보자."
msgstr "I’ll look around the roof first."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(306)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(306)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor2"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 창고 얘기가 있었지. 그 문부터 찾아보자."
msgstr "The lease said something about a storage room on the roof. I’ll look for that door first."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(307)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(307)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor3"
msgid "열쇠 꾸러미의 창고 열쇠로 그 철문을 열자."
msgstr "The storage key on the key ring should open that steel door."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(310)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall1"
msgid "벽마다 소리가 다른지 들어 보자."
msgstr "I should listen for a difference between these walls."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Criterion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(312)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(312)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Criterion"
msgid "수첩에 적혀 있었지. 빈 곳은 낮게 울리고 소리가 오래 간다고."
msgstr "His notebook said hollow sections give a low, lingering echo."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(313)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(313)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩을 읽어 보자. 오빠도 이 벽을 살펴봤을까."
msgstr "I’ll read the tuning notebook. Did Doha look at this wall too?"

#. Key:	NightThreeWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(314)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall3"
msgid "배관 밸브를 열고 벽마다 귀를 대 보자. 아니면 하나씩 두드려서 어디가 오래 울리는지 들어 보자."
msgstr "I’ll open the pipe valve and listen at each wall. Or knock on them one by one and see which echo lasts longest."

#. Key:	NightFour3Drain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(322)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(322)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Drain"
msgid "옥상 저수조의 세척 배수 밸브부터 열자."
msgstr "First, I’ll open the drain valve on the roof water tank."

#. Key:	NightFour3Bypass
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(324)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(324)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Bypass"
msgid "다음은 옥상 우회 밸브야."
msgstr "Next, the bypass valve on the roof."

#. Key:	NightFour3Pump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(325)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(325)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Pump"
msgid "마지막으로 1층 관리실의 이송 펌프를 수동으로 돌리자."
msgstr "Last, I’ll run the transfer pump in the first-floor office manually."

#. Key:	NightFour1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(327)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(327)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour1"
msgid "망치 소리가 너무 클 텐데. 좀 덜 들리게 할 수 없을까."
msgstr "The hammer will be loud. How can I cover some of the noise?"

#. Key:	NightFour2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(328)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(328)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour2"
msgid "물탱크 물을 빼면 배관이 시끄럽겠지. 관리실에 점검 메모 같은 게 있을지도."
msgstr "Draining the water tank should make the pipes loud. There might be inspection notes in the management office."

#. Key:	NightFourWall0a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(342)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(342)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0a"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 뜯어야 해."
msgstr "I have to take the wall apart while the water’s running."

#. Key:	NightFourWall0b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(343)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(343)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0b"
msgid "가운데 칸에만 판을 한 겹 더 댔어. 고정한 데를 찾자."
msgstr "Only the middle section has an extra layer of board. I’ll look for where it’s fastened."

#. Key:	NightFourWall0c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(344)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(344)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall0c"
msgid "위쪽 덧판 이음매를 망치로 치자. 테이프 밑에 나사가 있을 거야."
msgstr "I’ll hit the seam of the upper overlay board with the hammer. There should be screws under the tape."

#. Key:	NightFourWall1a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(347)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(347)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1a"
msgid "그게 이음매를 덮고 있어."
msgstr "That thing’s covering the seam."

#. Key:	NightFourWall1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(348)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(348)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1b"
msgid "다른 데 틈을 내주면 그리로 옮겨 갈까."
msgstr "If I open a gap somewhere else, would it move over there?"

#. Key:	NightFourWall1c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(349)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(349)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1c"
msgid "구석 쪽 작은 덧판을 떼어 내자. 밑에 틈이 있으면 그리로 옮겨 갈 거야."
msgstr "I’ll pry off the small overlay board in the corner. If there’s a gap under it, it’ll move there."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Ba
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(353)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(353)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Ba"
msgid "틀에 걸려서 몸을 못 접네."
msgstr "Caught on the frame. It can’t fold up."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bb
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(354)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(354)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bb"
msgid "이음매 위로 나사가 드러나 있었지."
msgstr "There were screws showing along the seam."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2Bc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(355)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(355)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2Bc"
msgid "드러난 덧판 나사를 망치로 쳐 내자."
msgstr "I’ll knock out the exposed screws in the overlay board with the hammer."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(357)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(357)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2a"
msgid "천장까지 몸을 폈어. 다시 접히면 벽으로 와."
msgstr "It’s stretched itself all the way to the ceiling. If it folds up again, it’ll go back to the wall."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(359)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(359)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2b"
msgid "구석에 철골 틀이 있었어."
msgstr "There was a steel frame in the corner."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2bUnseen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(360)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(360)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2bUnseen"
msgid "저 마디를 걸어 둘 만한 게 이 층에 없을까. 둘러보자."
msgstr "Is there anything on this floor I could catch that joint with? I’ll look around."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(361)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(361)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2c"
msgid "구석에 기대 둔 철골 틀을 점검구 앞에 세워서 저 무릎 마디를 걸자."
msgstr "I’ll stand the steel frame from the corner in front of the access hatch so it catches that knee joint."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(365)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(365)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3a"
msgid "틀이 밀렸어."
msgstr "The frame slipped."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(366)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(366)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3b"
msgid "저게 버티면서 틀을 밀고 있어."
msgstr "That thing’s pushing back against the frame."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(367)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(367)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3c"
msgid "밀린 틀을 다시 세우자."
msgstr "I’ll stand the slipped frame back up."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ia
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(369)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(369)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ia"
msgid "덧판은 떼어 냈어. 안쪽 판이 남았어."
msgstr "The overlay board’s off. The inner board is still there."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ib
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(370)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(370)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ib"
msgid "기둥을 따라 안쪽 판에도 나사가 박혀 있어."
msgstr "The inner board’s screwed in along the studs."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3Ic
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(371)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(371)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3Ic"
msgid "양쪽 기둥 자리의 나사를 쳐 내자."
msgstr "I’ll knock out the screws over the studs on both sides."

#. Key:	NightFourWall4a
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(374)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(374)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4a"
msgid "거의 다 됐어."
msgstr "Almost there."

#. Key:	NightFourWall4b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(375)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(375)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4b"
msgid "위에 철물 하나가 남았어."
msgstr "There’s one bracket left up top."

#. Key:	NightFourWall4c
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(376)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(376)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall4c"
msgid "위쪽 가운데 ㄱ자 철물을 쳐 내자."
msgstr "I’ll knock off the angle bracket up top, in the middle."

#. Key:	NightFourWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(382)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(382)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 쳐야 해."
msgstr "I have to hit the wall while the water’s running."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(383)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(383)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2"
msgid "낮에 사 온 망치가 있잖아. 5층 벽 앞으로 가자."
msgstr "I’ve got the hammer I bought today. Now to the fifth-floor wall."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(384)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(384)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3"
msgid "물소리가 날 때 5층 가운데 벽을 망치로 치자. 구멍이 날 때까지."
msgstr "While the water runs, I’ll take the hammer to the middle wall on the fifth floor until it gives."

#. Key:	NightFourReveal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(389)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(389)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal1"
msgid "벽 안을 봐야 해."
msgstr "I need to look inside the wall."

#. Key:	NightFourReveal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(390)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(390)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal2"
msgid "손전등으로 벽 안쪽을 비춰 보자."
msgstr "I’ll shine the flashlight into the wall."

#. Key:	NightFourChoice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(393)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(393)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice1"
msgid "오빠 곁에 가 보자."
msgstr "I’ll go to him."

#. Key:	NightFourChoice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(394)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(394)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice2"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 갈까. 아니면 녹음을 끄고 조금 더 있을까."
msgstr "I could leave his tuning hammer with him and go. Or stop recording and stay a little longer."

#. Key:	DayOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(405)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(405)
