msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door and ask her."

#. Key:	DayOne3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(407)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(407)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne3"
msgid "밤에는 1층 관리실에 가서 소음 민원 기록부터 보자."
msgstr "Tonight I’ll go to the first-floor office and look for noise complaint records first."

#. Key:	DayOneMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(409)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(409)
