msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayOneMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(411)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(411)
