msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(421)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(421)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 관리실에 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "Tonight, I’ll stop by the management office, then come back to 403."

#. Key:	DayThreePolice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(426)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(426)
