msgstr "The police are on their way."

#. Key:	DayThreePolice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(427)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(427)
