msgid "4층 복도를 한번 둘러보자."
msgstr "I should take a look around the fourth-floor hallway."

#. Key:	DayThreeNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(434)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(434)
