msgid "어젯밤엔 끝까지 못 갔어."
msgstr "I didn’t get far enough last night."

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(443)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(443)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(444)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(444)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 5층 벽 앞까지 가 보자."
msgstr "Tonight, I’ll try to reach the fifth-floor wall."

#. Key:	DayOther1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(447)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(447)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOther1"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	NightOneAfter1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(488)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(488)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOneAfter1"
msgid "위에서 형광등 소리가 났어."
msgstr "I heard a fluorescent light humming above me."

