msgstr "I’ll listen under the ceiling in the fourth-floor hallway. After that, I can rest in the bed in Unit 403."

#. Key:	NightRest1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(493)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(493)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightRest1"
msgid "오늘은 여기까지 보자."
msgstr "That’s enough for tonight."

#. Key:	NightRest2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(494)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(494)
