msgstr "If there’s anything left to look at, I’ll finish up. Otherwise, I’ll rest."

#. Key:	NightRest3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(495)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(495)
