msgstr "All three are in. What does the front look like?"

#. Key:	AssemblyFlip2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(65)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(65)
