#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6728)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6728)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AccessibilityResetArmed"
msgid "한 번 더 누르면 초기화"
msgstr "Press again to reset"

#. Key:	A11yHintsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6735)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6735)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHintsDesc"
msgid "힌트 키를 누르면 다음에 살펴볼 곳을 알려 줍니다. 다시 누르면 더 자세한 힌트가 나옵니다."
msgstr "Press the hint key for a clue about where to look next. Press again for a more detailed hint."

#. Key:	A11yReducedMotionDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6736)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6736)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yReducedMotionDesc"
msgid "걷거나 쫓길 때 화면이 덜 흔들리게 합니다."
msgstr "Reduces camera shake while you walk or are being chased."

#. Key:	A11yReducedFlickerDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6737)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6737)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yReducedFlickerDesc"
msgid "손전등과 조명이 빠르게 깜빡이는 효과를 줄입니다."
msgstr "Reduces rapid flickering from the flashlight and other lights."

#. Key:	A11yFieldOfViewDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6738)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6738)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yFieldOfViewDesc"
msgid "화면에 보이는 범위를 넓히거나 좁힙니다. 시야가 좁게 느껴지거나 어지럽다면 값을 바꿔 보세요."
msgstr "Widens or narrows how much you can see. Try a different setting if the view feels too narrow or makes you dizzy."

#. Key:	A11yVignetteDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6739)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6739)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yVignetteDesc"
msgid "화면 가장자리를 어둡게 합니다. 움직일 때 어지럽다면 값을 높여 보세요."
msgstr "Darkens the edges of the screen. Raise it if moving around makes you dizzy."

#. Key:	A11yCameraTextureDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6740)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6740)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCameraTextureDesc"
msgid "화면 가장자리에 약한 렌즈 왜곡 효과를 더합니다. 눈이 피로하면 낮춰 주세요."
msgstr "Adds subtle lens distortion around the edges. Turn it down if your eyes get tired."

#. Key:	A11yCenterDotDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6741)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6741)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCenterDotDesc"
msgid "조사할 물건을 보면 화면 가운데에 점이 뜹니다. 어지럽다면 항상 표시하도록 바꿔 보세요. 시선을 둘 곳이 생깁니다."
msgstr "Shows a dot when you look at an object you can examine. Select Always to keep a fixed point on screen if you experience motion sickness."

#. Key:	A11yFearDirectionDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6742)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6742)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yFearDirectionDesc"
msgid "중요한 소리가 나면 화면 가장자리에 그 방향을 표시합니다."
msgstr "Shows the direction of important sounds at the edge of the screen."

#. Key:	A11yKnockRingDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6743)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6743)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockRingDesc"
msgid "켜면 위층 사람이 낸 소리도 얇은 원으로 표시합니다. 내가 낸 소리는 늘 굵은 원입니다."
msgstr "When on, sounds from the one upstairs also appear as thin rings. Sounds you make always appear as thick rings."

#. Key:	A11yKnockHapticDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6744)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6744)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockHapticDesc"
msgid "위층 사람이 소리를 내면 게임패드가 진동합니다. 멀리서 나는 소리일수록 진동도 약해집니다."
msgstr "The gamepad vibrates when the one upstairs makes a sound. More distant sounds produce weaker vibrations."

#. Key:	A11yHeartbeatDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6745)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHeartbeatDesc"
msgid "긴장하면 화면 가장자리가 심장 박동에 맞춰 어두워졌다 밝아집니다."
msgstr "When you’re tense, the edges of the screen darken and lighten with your heartbeat."

#. Key:	A11yKnockAssistDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6746)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6746)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockAssistDesc"
msgid "박자가 조금 늦거나 빨라도 맞은 것으로 칩니다."
msgstr "Knocks still count if your timing is a little early or late."

#. Key:	A11ySoundCaptionsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6747)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6747)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11ySoundCaptionsDesc"
msgid "소리를 글로 보여 줍니다. ‘중요한 소리’는 두드리는 소리나 다가오는 발소리처럼 진행에 필요한 소리만, ‘모든 소리’는 건물과 동네의 평범한 소리까지 보여 줍니다."
msgstr "Shows sounds as text. ‘Important sounds’ covers knocks and footsteps; ‘All sounds’ adds the rest."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionSizeDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6748)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6748)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionSizeDesc"
msgid "대화와 소리 자막의 글자 크기를 함께 바꿉니다. 아래에서 미리 볼 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Changes the text size of both dialogue and sound captions. You can preview it below."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionBackgroundDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6749)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6749)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionBackgroundDesc"
msgid "자막 뒤의 검은 배경을 얼마나 진하게 표시할지 정합니다."
msgstr "Sets how dark the background behind captions is."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionSafeAreaDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6750)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6750)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionSafeAreaDesc"
msgid "값을 줄이면 자막이 화면 안쪽에 표시됩니다."
msgstr "Lower values move captions in from the edges of the screen."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionDurationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6751)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6751)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionDurationDesc"
msgid "자막이 화면에 떠 있는 시간을 조절합니다. 읽을 시간이 부족하면 값을 높여 주세요."
msgstr "Changes how long captions stay on screen. Raise it if you need more time to read."

#. Key:	A11yCrouchInputDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6752)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6752)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCrouchInputDesc"
msgid "앉기 키를 한 번 눌러 전환하거나, 누르고 있는 동안만 유지하도록 선택합니다."
msgstr "Choose whether one press toggles crouching, or you crouch only while holding the key."

#. Key:	A11yHoldInputDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6753)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6753)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHoldInputDesc"
msgid "버튼을 길게 누르기 어렵다면 한 번 눌러 시작하고 다시 눌러 취소하도록 바꿀 수 있습니다."
msgstr "If holding a button is difficult, you can press once to start and press again to cancel instead."

#. Key:	A11yHoldDurationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6754)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6754)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHoldDurationDesc"
msgid "문을 열거나 조사할 때 버튼을 얼마나 오래 누를지 정합니다."
msgstr "Sets how long you hold the button to open doors or examine things."

#. Key:	A11yPromptKeysDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6755)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6755)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yPromptKeysDesc"
msgid "‘항상’으로 두면 누를 키를 계속 표시합니다. ‘익힐 때까지’로 두면 같은 동작을 세 번 한 뒤부터 키 이름을 숨깁니다."
msgstr "Always keeps key names on screen. First Three Uses hides a key name after you’ve performed that action three times."

#. Key:	A11yHapticsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6756)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6756)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHapticsDesc"
msgid "게임패드 진동을 켜거나 끕니다."
msgstr "Turns gamepad vibration on or off."

#. Key:	A11yMicrophoneDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6757)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6757)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yMicrophoneDesc"
msgid "켜면 마이크로 들어오는 내 목소리와 주변 소리에 위층 사람이 반응합니다."
msgstr "When enabled, the one upstairs can hear your voice and other sounds picked up by your microphone."

#. Key:	A11yResetDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6758)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6758)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yResetDesc"
msgid "이 화면의 설정을 처음 상태로 되돌립니다."
msgstr "Resets the settings on this screen to their defaults."

#. Key:	A11yCloseDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6759)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6759)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCloseDesc"
msgid "설정을 저장하고 이전 화면으로 돌아갑니다."
msgstr "Saves your settings and returns to the previous screen."

