msgid "두드리는 소리가 잘 들리면서\n귀에 부담이 없는 크기로 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "Adjust the volume until you can hear the knocks clearly\nwithout them being uncomfortably loud."

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationShadowLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7731)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7731)
