#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(7740)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationShadowInstruction"
msgid "가운데 칸이 희미하게 보이도록 맞춰 주세요.\n왼쪽 칸은 배경과 구분되지 않아야 합니다."
msgstr "Adjust until the middle square is barely visible.\nThe left square should blend into the background."

